101
00:06:58.073 --> 00:06:58.947
Part 2.

102
00:06:59.227 --> 00:07:01.105
Core Concepts, Beginner to Deep.

103
00:07:02.355 --> 00:07:04.765
Intuition: a courteous mystery shopper.

104
00:07:05.045 --> 00:07:07.264
A mystery shopper visits many shops.

105
00:07:07.544 --> 00:07:10.168
They don't send fifty people into one shop at once.

106
00:07:10.448 --> 00:07:15.333
They don't visit the same shop's aisle twice because the aisle sign was spelled differently.

107
00:07:15.613 --> 00:07:18.856
They visit the flash-sale shelf more often than the rice aisle.

108
00:07:19.136 --> 00:07:23.595
They ignore staff only signs never, and they don't wander into the infinite storeroom.

109
00:07:23.875 --> 00:07:28.717
When a shop publishes a price list at the door, they read it instead of walking every aisle.

110
00:07:30.067 --> 00:07:31.027
Requirements.

111
00:07:31.307 --> 00:07:32.161
Functional.

112
00:07:32.441 --> 00:07:35.726
Discover and track product URLs on configured sites.

113
00:07:36.006 --> 00:07:42.086
Fetch, extract structured fields (price, MRP, availability, pack size), and store the history.

114
00:07:42.366 --> 00:07:49.662
Re-crawl on schedules driven by change rate and business value; detect changes; publish events for price changes.

115
00:07:49.942 --> 00:07:58.369
Respect robots.txt, crawl-delay and site-specific limits; identify ourselves (user agent, contact URL).

116
00:07:58.649 --> 00:08:03.726
Match competitor products to our SKUs (brand, pack size, barcode where present).

117
00:08:04.006 --> 00:08:05.649
This matching feeds pricing.

118
00:08:06.999 --> 00:08:08.108
Non-functional.

119
00:08:08.388 --> 00:08:10.905
Politeness: never exceed per-site limits.

120
00:08:11.185 --> 00:08:14.513
Back off on 429 or 503.

121
00:08:14.793 --> 00:08:16.201
Circuit-break on errors.

122
00:08:16.481 --> 00:08:21.260
Scale: millions of fetches a day across hundreds of sites; horizontal scaling.

123
00:08:21.540 --> 00:08:25.593
Freshness targets per class (flash deals 1 h, staples 1 day).

124
00:08:25.873 --> 00:08:30.183
Robustness: extraction failures are detected, not silently stored.

