00:12:38.265 --> 00:12:39.545
Canonicalisation:

218
00:12:39.825 --> 00:12:43.644
Lower-case the scheme and host, and drop default ports and fragments.

219
00:12:43.924 --> 00:12:50.324
Remove tracking and session parameters (utm, gclid, fbclid, sid), and sort query parameters.

220
00:12:50.604 --> 00:12:52.289
Normalise trailing slashes.

221
00:12:52.569 --> 00:12:55.897
Prefer the page's link rel=canonical once fetched.

222
00:12:57.247 --> 00:13:01.813
Keep site-specific rules (which parameters matter: size does, ref doesn't).

223
00:13:02.093 --> 00:13:11.501
Hash sets of 64-bit fingerprints are exact for practical purposes at millions of URLs (collision probability ~n² or 2⁶⁵).

224
00:13:11.781 --> 00:13:17.327
Bloom filters are right for web-scale discovery, where missing 0.2% is fine.

225
00:13:17.607 --> 00:13:23.965
They are wrong for a price monitor that must see every product: a false positive is a product we never fetch.

226
00:13:24.245 --> 00:13:25.269
Content dedup:

227
00:13:25.549 --> 00:13:28.770
