490
00:31:23.066 --> 00:31:23.919
Reading it:

491
00:31:24.199 --> 00:31:28.317
Without canonicalisation, four of every five fetches are duplicates.

492
00:31:28.597 --> 00:31:35.573
Canonical fingerprints are exact at 64 MB, against about 1.5 GB for raw strings.

493
00:31:35.853 --> 00:31:38.007
The string memory figures are estimates.

494
00:31:38.287 --> 00:31:44.922
The Bloom filter is about 28 times smaller again, but 3,380 products are never fetched.

495
00:31:45.202 --> 00:31:49.682
That is below its 1% design rate, because the filter fills gradually.

496
00:31:51.032 --> 00:31:52.931
L3, Re-crawl scheduling.

497
00:31:53.211 --> 00:31:54.149
Requirement:

498
00:31:54.429 --> 00:32:01.683
With 400,000 fetches a day, keep as many competitor prices current as possible, especially flash deals.

499
00:32:01.963 --> 00:32:05.013
100k pages with different price-change rates.

500
00:32:05.293 --> 00:32:09.197
Days 1 to 3 are for learning; days 4 to 10 are evaluated.

