550
00:37:04.001 --> 00:37:04.939
Part 6.

551
00:37:05.219 --> 00:37:06.499
Production Concerns.

552
00:37:07.749 --> 00:37:08.901
Failure modes.

553
00:37:09.181 --> 00:37:10.525
Here is a quick table:

554
00:37:10.805 --> 00:37:13.088
Failure, and Symptom, and Mitigation.

555
00:37:13.368 --> 00:37:15.437
Global queue, no per-host limits.

556
00:37:15.717 --> 00:37:16.528
Symptom:

557
00:37:16.808 --> 00:37:19.304
429s, bans (L1).

558
00:37:19.584 --> 00:37:20.587
Mitigation:

559
00:37:20.867 --> 00:37:23.491
Per-host back queues, adaptive politeness.

560
00:37:23.771 --> 00:37:25.179
Polite waiting in place.

561
00:37:25.459 --> 00:37:26.269
Symptom:

562
00:37:26.549 --> 00:37:28.043
Low throughput (L1).

563
00:37:28.323 --> 00:37:29.325
Mitigation:

564
00:37:29.605 --> 00:37:30.971
Ready-host scheduling.

565
00:37:31.251 --> 00:37:32.765
No canonicalisation.

566
00:37:33.045 --> 00:37:33.856
Symptom:

567
00:37:34.136 --> 00:37:36.056
Duplicate fetches (L2).

568
00:37:36.336 --> 00:37:37.339
Mitigation:

569
00:37:37.619 --> 00:37:39.453
Site rules, canonical links.

570
00:37:39.733 --> 00:37:41.632
Bloom filter for tracked pages.

571
00:37:41.912 --> 00:37:42.723
Symptom:

572
00:37:43.003 --> 00:37:44.816
Products never fetched (L2).

573
00:37:45.096 --> 00:37:46.099
Mitigation:

574
00:37:46.379 --> 00:37:47.808
Exact fingerprint sets.

575
00:37:48.088 --> 00:37:49.688
Whole-page change detection.

576
00:37:49.968 --> 00:37:50.779
Symptom:

577
00:37:51.059 --> 00:37:52.787
Wasted budget (L3).

578
00:37:53.067 --> 00:37:54.069
Mitigation:

579
00:37:54.349 --> 00:37:55.864
Hash extracted fields.

580
00:37:56.144 --> 00:37:57.531
Proportional re-crawl.

581
00:37:57.811 --> 00:37:58.621
Symptom:

582
00:37:58.901 --> 00:38:00.949
Starved slow pages (L3).

583
00:38:01.229 --> 00:38:02.232
Mitigation:

584
00:38:02.512 --> 00:38:04.837
Optimal allocation, floors, weights.

585
00:38:05.117 --> 00:38:05.928
Traps.

586
00:38:06.208 --> 00:38:07.019
Symptom:

587
00:38:07.299 --> 00:38:09.112
Budget exhausted (L4).

588
00:38:09.392 --> 00:38:10.395
Mitigation:

589
00:38:10.675 --> 00:38:12.424
Templates, robots, sitemaps.

590
00:38:13.774 --> 00:38:14.905
Site redesign.

591
00:38:15.185 --> 00:38:15.995
Symptom:

592
00:38:16.275 --> 00:38:17.833
Wrong or empty prices.

593
00:38:18.113 --> 00:38:19.115
Mitigation:

594
00:38:19.395 --> 00:38:21.721
Validation, quarantine, canaries.

595
00:38:22.001 --> 00:38:23.707
JavaScript-only pages.

596
00:38:23.987 --> 00:38:24.798
Symptom:

597
00:38:25.078 --> 00:38:26.315
Empty extraction.

598
00:38:26.595 --> 00:38:27.598
Mitigation:

599
00:38:27.878 --> 00:38:29.585
Selective headless rendering.

600
00:38:30.935 --> 00:38:32.023
Observability.

601
00:38:32.303 --> 00:38:42.116
Per site: request rate versus limit, 429 or 503 rates, bans (sudden 403s), latency, error circuit state.

602
00:38:42.396 --> 00:38:47.857
Extraction success per site and extractor version; quarantine volume; canary results.

603
00:38:48.137 --> 00:38:53.023
Freshness per class; mean age of wrong prices (estimated from change detection).

604
00:38:53.303 --> 00:38:56.524
Frontier depth per host; throughput; DNS errors.

605
00:38:57.874 --> 00:38:59.794
Security, legal and ethics.

606
00:39:00.074 --> 00:39:03.274
Identified user agent with a contact URL.

607
00:39:03.554 --> 00:39:05.986
Honour robots.txt and opt-outs.

608
00:39:06.266 --> 00:39:09.061
Public pages only, and no personal data.

609
00:39:09.341 --> 00:39:13.479
No circumvention of access controls, CAPTCHAs or bot defences.

610
00:39:13.759 --> 00:39:18.261
If a site blocks us, stop and escalate to legal or business, don't evade.

611
00:39:18.541 --> 00:39:28.397
Crawlers fetch untrusted content: sandbox parsers and headless browsers, and protect against SSRF (resolve and block internal IP ranges).

612
00:39:29.747 --> 00:39:30.643
Performance.

613
00:39:30.923 --> 00:39:36.021
Async I or O fetchers (thousands of concurrent connections per node across hosts).

614
00:39:36.301 --> 00:39:40.099
Connection reuse per host within politeness limits, and compression.

615
00:39:40.379 --> 00:39:44.219
Listing pages as a cheap way to update many prices per fetch.

616
00:39:45.569 --> 00:39:46.294
Cost.

617
00:39:46.574 --> 00:39:48.963
Headless rendering is the expensive tier.

618
00:39:49.243 --> 00:39:50.246
Minimise it.

619
00:39:50.526 --> 00:39:55.091
Store raw HTML briefly, and keep only extracted fields long-term.

620
00:39:55.371 --> 00:39:58.486
The re-crawl budget is the main cost lever (L3).

621
00:39:59.836 --> 00:40:00.775
