4.

637
00:40:29.957 --> 00:40:32.240
Bloom filters where completeness matters.

638
00:40:32.520 --> 00:40:34.120
Silent misses (L2).

639
00:40:35.470 --> 00:40:36.387
Watch out:

640
00:40:36.667 --> 00:40:37.435
5.

641
00:40:37.715 --> 00:40:39.891
Whole-page hashes for change detection.

642
00:40:40.171 --> 00:40:42.539
Everything always changes (L3).

643
00:40:43.889 --> 00:40:44.807
Watch out:

644
00:40:45.087 --> 00:40:45.833
6.

645
00:40:46.113 --> 00:40:48.631
Re-crawling in proportion to change rate.

646
00:40:48.911 --> 00:40:50.895
Starves most pages (L3).

647
