Watch out:

660
00:41:16.396 --> 00:41:17.100
10.

661
00:41:17.380 --> 00:41:19.620
Publishing unvalidated extractions.

662
00:41:19.900 --> 00:41:21.415
0 rupeesprices.

663
00:41:22.765 --> 00:41:23.682
Watch out:

664
00:41:23.962 --> 00:41:24.794
11.

